    <description>When a type category of tasks are completed move the stage of the opportunity &amp; stamp completed dates
2026-05-05: Fixed stage not advancing when hardware tasks complete — added Hardware rule to Determine_Stage_to_Set, fixed Workflow rule to route to Post-Training, updated Workflow_Training_Complete formula to handle plans with no workflow tasks, and fixed Not Needed tasks being excluded from completion rollups
